    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a choice-based  VN.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018440/extras/c1931b85a8d512f46e0a5e73a860f4c9.avif?t=1754507023\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carissa is the most beloved nun at the Cathedral of Saint Estelle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One night, she has a dream about a witch being violated by the Templar Knights. When she awakens, she discovers that the atmosphere of the entire cathedral has become eerie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It starts with herself losing her chastity to a tentacled creature resembling an octopus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are cases of serial dismemberment within the cathedral, people succumbing to bizarre forms of madness or committing inexplicable suicides, all accompanied by a faint sweet scent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The entire cathedral is shrouded in an unknown fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Cathedral of Saint Estelle has been cursed by a demon returned from hell. It is foreseen to be doomed in five days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through the friendship and communication between the characters Carissa and Betsy, players assist the protagonists in attaining a happy ending in this lifetime, while unraveling the mysteries of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this cathedral cloaked in darkness\u2014demons, epidemics, war-wounded soldiers, forbidden potions, lurking serial killers, and the ancient taboo alchemy\u2014much like destiny, these elements come together like a grand overture for a party that intricately link the past and present lives of the main characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unravel the mysteries and curses, and embrace a new future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c7</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018440/extras/cf5d938171c3393265bb5a6ae454be49.avif?t=1754507023\" /></div>Carissa is the most beautiful nun and is famous in the area</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She is very kind and helpful</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But she's also often careless enough to screw things up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To her, Benson and Betsy are friends and like family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018440/extras/6e1a628d97d95d86c3e0ccd99afd2bbc.avif?t=1754507023\" /></div>Betsy is very smart and helps the cathedral solve various difficulties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She also often helps the careless Carissa.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Betsy has complicated feelings for Carissa.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Although she is jealous of her, she cannot hate her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She grew up in the same orphanage as Carissa, and she exists like Carissa's sister.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She is very good friends with Benson and Carissa and is secretly in love with Benson.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018440/extras/d0f10466a483ecc0562c96dddd598821.avif?t=1754507023\" /></div>Benson is the adopted son of Bishop Carl</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Handsome and knowledgeable, quite popular.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">He is quite polite to everyone, but he also has a sense of distance because of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Benson often has inexplicable scars on his body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">He did not mention why. Only Betsy noticed this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Benson has noticed Betsy's feelings for him, but his current attitude towards her is still the same as usual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Good friends with Carissa and Betsy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018440/extras/92f6c1def7059a545cac0e903eecda6a.avif?t=1754507023\" /></div>Bishop Carl is the leader of the cathedral.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">He is a gambler and has a lot of gambling debts, so there have been a lot of rumors about him recently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018440/extras/df5438d59db8ebf2f8201147739e618a.avif?t=1754507023\" /></div>The mysterious woman who appeared in the cathedral one night seemed to be related to the devil and alchemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018440/extras/56ce114a9e3e9643bb3f9253285a6ffb.avif?t=1754507023\" /></div>A man who came to the cathedral one night</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Extremely obsessed with Carissa</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018440/extras/941131fe48d5bc2bca26c4ce44c86203.avif?t=1754507023\" /></div>The killer who committed quite a few serial dismemberment cases,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">his cruelty is outrageous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smiling graffiti drawn with the victim's blood will be left at the crime scene,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and is known as the &quot;Smiling Murderer&quot; by the outside world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Since the identity of the murderer cannot be determined,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">there are currently only a few eyewitness testimonies,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Some said he was a &quot;tall and thin young man&quot; or a &quot;man&quot; wearing strange clothes and a mask.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There have been similar cases in the cathedral recently, could it be...?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a choice-based  VN.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018440/extras/c1931b85a8d512f46e0a5e73a860f4c9.avif?t=1754507023\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carissa is the most beloved nun at the Cathedral of Saint Estelle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One night, she has a dream about a witch being violated by the Templar Knights. When she awakens, she discovers that the atmosphere of the entire cathedral has become eerie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It starts with herself losing her chastity to a tentacled creature resembling an octopus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are cases of serial dismemberment within the cathedral, people succumbing to bizarre forms of madness or committing inexplicable suicides, all accompanied by a faint sweet scent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The entire cathedral is shrouded in an unknown fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Cathedral of Saint Estelle has been cursed by a demon returned from hell. It is foreseen to be doomed in five days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through the friendship and communication between the characters Carissa and Betsy, players assist the protagonists in attaining a happy ending in this lifetime, while unraveling the mysteries of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this cathedral cloaked in darkness\u2014demons, epidemics, war-wounded soldiers, forbidden potions, lurking serial killers, and the ancient taboo alchemy\u2014much like destiny, these elements come together like a grand overture for a party that intricately link the past and present lives of the main characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unravel the mysteries and curses, and em