ng graffiti drawn with the victim's blood will be left at the crime scene,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and is known as the &quot;Smiling Murderer&quot; by the outside world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Since the identity of the murderer cannot be determined,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">there are currently only a few eyewitness testimonies,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Some said he was a &quot;tall and thin young man&quot; or a &quot;man&quot; wearing strange clothes and a mask.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There have been similar cases in the cathedral recently, could it be...?</p>",
